## Domain Rules — Gold Shop (CRITICAL):
- Gold price formula: vazn * ayar / 750 * gheymat_geram
- ayar is per-mille (750=18k, 875=21k, 1000=24k) — NEVER karat number
- gheymat_geram = price per gram of 18k (750) gold (Iran market standard)
- Products: tala abshode (by vazn), sekke (by tedad), noghre, dollar, shemsh
- All money/weight: Decimal from STRING only → Decimal("10.5") not Decimal(10.5)
- NEVER use float for any monetary or weight calculation

## OOP Conventions:
- Class names: PascalCase (Kala, Faktor, Moshtari, Anbar, Sanad, Hesab)
- Private attributes: _name prefix (encapsulation)
- Validation in setter methods
- super().__init__() always in child classes
- Composition over inheritance where possible

## Naming (Finglish — stick to this):
- Attributes: nam, vazn, ayar, gheymat, mande, tedad, ayar, shomare
- Classes: Kala, TalaAbshode, Sekke, Moshtari, Faktor, Anbar, Sanad
- Methods: add_kala, set_vazn, set_ayar, arzesh, jam_kol, nahae_kardan

## Code Style:
- Always use Decimal, never float
- Validate all inputs (positive numbers, valid ayar range 1-1000)
- Every class needs __str__
- Auto-increment IDs via class attributes (shomare_baadi)

## Auto-import Rules:
- NEVER suggest: multiprocessing, ast, numpy, pandas (not needed)
- OK to suggest: decimal, datetime, typing, dataclasses